1) Messenger: Sync & Queued Message Handling — https://symfony.com/doc/current/messenger.html  
   The official Symfony Messenger guide covering dispatching, transports, routing, handlers, middleware, failure & retry handling, and usage examples for sync and async messaging.

2) The Messenger Component (Symfony 7.3 Docs) — https://symfony.com/doc/7.3/components/messenger.html  
   Versioned component documentation describing how to use the Messenger component (standalone or in apps), its API, and component-specific usage details.

3) Messenger component (Symfony Packages) — https://symfony.com/packages/messenger  
   Package page with installation instructions, links to the component source, Packagist stats, and quick links to the full documentation.

